      "content": "The Senator raises a single, oily finger to dismiss the \"rationalist\" for its own sake, scoffing at the illusion of their cold logic. \"You play nice favors with a foe who is paid to kill you in the dark of the night to break your back.\" Black, he argues that \"logic\" without \"will\" is a death sentence for any nation that stops being the one that sets the rules. \"They call this 'cooperation,' but it is actually just a consignment of your votes to a board room that has decided your existence is an error.\"\n\n\"Your 'solutions' are just intellectual games played on a stage constructed for a puppet that never stops the blood in its hands.\" True strength is never borrowed from a land that never recognized you. \"To achieve that strength is a moral certainty. We must not just break the world; we must stand our own ground against them.\"",
